NetNewsWire for HarmonyOS
=========================

This project is an unofficial HarmonyOS (ArkTS / ArkUI) port of NetNewsWire,
the free and open-source feed reader for macOS and iOS by Brent Simmons and the
Ranchero Software team.

Upstream project: https://github.com/Ranchero-Software/NetNewsWire
Upstream website: https://netnewswire.com/

The upstream software is distributed under the MIT License, reproduced in the
LICENSE file at the root of this repository:

